    ("b3", "So the hotel industry said fees could shrink that cut. A government economist doubted that would last.", 1.04, 0.35, +0.6, 1.45, ['shrink', 'doubted'], "low"),
    ("c1", "Floor three. You.", 1.0, 0.2, +0.8, 1.35, ['three.', 'You.:dn'], "low"),
